WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.160
Our police department responds to every single 911 call.

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:10.580
When 911 is called and there's an emergency, our police department shows up, as they've

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:11.580
always done.

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:15.440
Our police officers respond to every single emergency in this city.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:23.040
The brave women and men who sign up to serve and protect this city are committed to keeping

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:23.600
us safe.

